About the work from home job/internship
Kraftisium is an AI-powered job search and resume-matching platform for candidates and employers. We help students and early-career talent discover roles that fit their skills — and we want strong campus voices to grow that community.

Selected intern's day-to-day responsibilities include:

1. Act as the official Kraftisium Campus Ambassador at your college — own brand presence on campus and in student groups.
2. Run awareness drives: classroom talks, placement-cell sessions, WhatsApp/Telegram communities, fest booths, and notice-board campaigns.
3. Onboard students onto Kraftisium (sign-ups, resume upload, AI Matches usage) and help them complete their first successful profile setup.
4. Collect feedback from students on what they need from job search tooling; flag insights weekly to the founding team.
5. Create simple campus content (posts, short reels, posters) that explains Kraftisium clearly — no jargon.
6. Coordinate with training & placement officers / student clubs for workshops and partnership access.
7. Track weekly numbers (sign-ups, resumes uploaded, active users) and report against targets.

Skill(s) required
Effective Communication
Social Media Marketing
Event Management
Networking
Canva / basic content creation
English Proficiency (Spoken)

